# Repository boundary
# By default, keep the root repository focused on the mini-program frontend and
# the backend/admin service. Root-level scratch files, local agent assets, raw
# design materials, archives and secrets stay out of Git unless explicitly
# allowed below.
/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!PRODUCT.md
!小程序自动编译说明.md
!uni-app/
!uni-app/**
!ai-creator-server/
!ai-creator-server/**

# Non-runtime drafts inside allowed project folders
ai-creator-server/admin-web/prototypes/
ai-creator-server/image.codesonline.dev生图API调用说明*.md
ai-creator-server/docs/CLAUDE.MD

# Sensitive configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
**/.env.installed
APIKEY.md

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs and generated packages
**/dist/
**/build/
**/unpackage/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar

# Local IDE and platform-private files
**/.DS_Store
**/.hbuilderx/
**/project.private.config.json
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# Runtime data and local install state
**/uploads/
**/logs/
**/backups/
**/runtime/
**/update-packages/
**/.install-state.json
**/.pm2/
**/test-results/

# Local automation, QA and temporary workspaces
.agents/
.claude/
.codex-qa/
tmp/
**/.claude/
**/.codex-qa/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache
*.bak
*.swp
